<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93878" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σησᾰμο-ειδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like sesame</i> or
				<i>sesame-seeds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.13.6
			</span></i>; of bones, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				2.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σησαμοειδές, τό</span>, <i>fruit of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλλέβορος μέλας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.162
			</span></i>; used medicinally, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Acut.(Sp.</i>)<i><span class="en">
				60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; hellebore from Anticyra acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				152
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. φάρμακον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.3.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὸ μικρόν</span>, <i>purple
				rock-cress, Aubrietia deltoidea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.163
			</span></i> (also called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὸ λευκόν</span>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> ibid.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὸ μέγα</span>, <i>bastard rocket,
				Reseda alba</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.149
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
